35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The incident logs show eleven misrouted deliveries this year.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The coordination group is understaffed; two people do all notes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Half the customer plants lose network coverage for afternoons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The capital line is frozen, but software allowance has room.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Tools needing daily entry from everyone were quietly dropped.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Kenji That matches my finding on copying records.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,@Daisuke The vendor queries show repeated certificate requests.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji Fixed-fee work has held rates, but licences climb.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,@Shunichi So we should avoid per-head licence models.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,@All Narrow tools for one trade still run well.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The time lost to copying is nearly an hour daily.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The staffing gap means no one has time for new work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Developer availability is blocked until the third quarter.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We must fit within the recurring software allowance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Cross-unit standardization often ends without an owner.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We need a solution that reduces daily friction.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,It must not rely on extra unpaid labor.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,It cannot depend on unstable network access.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,It must be affordable within the current software budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"It should be a narrow tool, not a broad platform.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
